---
source: crates/lsw-cli/src/cli.rs
expression: "render_help(&[\"env\"])"
---
Manage isolated Windows-target environments

Usage: env <COMMAND>

Commands:
  create          Create an isolated environment (Wine prefix + toolchain probe)
  list            List environments
  restore         Recreate an environment from lsw.lock and verify it matches the pins
  clone           Clone an environment (reflink copy where the filesystem supports it)
  remove          Delete an environment and its Wine prefix
  provision       Provision the environment's prefix with extra components
  export          Pack an environment into a portable .tar.zst (CI cache handoff)
  import-archive  Restore an environment from an exported archive
  help            Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
